    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d663f965-575e-5e29-a588-db6fe6925acc" activityNameId="d25aacff-d1f1-5d5a-bd3d-6a50fec7edd3" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, liquefied natural gas, freight ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, liquefied natural gas, freight ship
na;
UUID: 5c2c05cd-e093-3517-82db-f9a2b1389b70
This dataset describes the transport of LNG on a LNG tanker. It includes leakage and the use of evaporated natural gas for the turbine.; Geography: The data stems from the maritime sector of the Snam fleet (Italy) 1998/1999.
Location:  The data stems from the maritime sector of the Snam fleet (Italy) 1998/1999.
Technology: The fleet of SNAM is for one half very recent (2 boats went in service 1997 and 1998). All tankers are equipped with a turbine to burn boil-off gas, which reduces the leakages of natural gas. Italy imports about 3% of the total transported LNG gas in the world. The losses of natural gas amount to 0.094m3/t LNG transported (0.0696 m3/t in 1999).
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: 136.96 e9 Nm3 (world)
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: The emissions data are calculated on the basis of the energy consumption and with the emissions of a standard turbine.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c2c05cd-e093-3517-82db-f9a2b1389b70.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
